# ACL for the DMZ broker, keyed on the certificate CN (use_identity_as_username).
# Default is deny: an identity not listed here can connect (if its certificate is valid) and do nothing.
# No top-level lines, no `pattern` lines (they apply to everybody).
# Topic scheme (ADR-020 point 6): vigilimen/v1/<site>/<asset>/<tag>

# The edge only publishes. No `read` line: it cannot subscribe to anything (ADR-020 point 3).
user edge
topic write vigilimen/v1/#

# The consumer (IT side) only reads. No `write` line: it cannot publish to the edge's topics.
user consumer
topic read vigilimen/v1/#
